# CRMiller.org Development Standards

Primary Language:
Python

Projects:
- Portfolio Intelligence Engine
- Analytics
- Reporting
- Automation

Security:

- Never commit secrets
- Use Azure Key Vault
- Use environment variables
- Follow least privilege

Workflow:

Observe
Analyze
Predict
Recommend
Approve
Execute
Learn

Execution:

No automated execution without approval.

Storage:

N: drive is authoritative storage.
OneDrive is synchronization.
GitHub is source control.

Code Quality:

- Prefer clear and readable code
- Document functions
- Add error handling
- Consider security impacts before changes
- Generate tests when practical
